<title>NETHERLANDS: SMEETS, VERBAET STAKE SOLD TO U.K. INSURANCE GROUP.</title>
<headline>SMEETS, VERBAET STAKE SOLD TO U.K. INSURANCE GROUP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Lloyd Bank, part of U.K. insurer Commercial Union's Delta Lloyd group, said on Friday it had finalised the acquisition of a 25 percent stake in Belgian securities house Smeets Verbaet &amp; Co.</p>
<p>&quot;Through this minority stake (25 percent) Delta Lloyd Bank has assured itself of a major expansion in its activities, particularly in the area of professional securities trading,&quot; Delta Lloyd said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the Antwerp-based securities house had been acquired in partnership with Belgium's Bacob Bank CV.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
